  "term": "chronic myofascial pain",
  "definition": "Chronic myofascial pain is a long-lasting pain syndrome discussed here as a condition linked with pain-related disability. In this source, it is examined in relation to anxiety, motor cortex excitability, and the way pain is modulated.",
